message: If you use this software, please cite both the archive and the paper.
type: software
title: ecg-acquisition-context-audit
abstract: >-
  Pipeline, pre-declared comparison files, run records and aggregate
  results for an audit of how much of an ECG deep learning benchmark's
  reported prognostic value is carried by the circumstances in which
  the electrocardiogram was recorded.
